SECURE ENTRY - SQL SEMAK SYNC STATUS (7 SITE)
Prepared for Edos

NOTA:
- Jalankan SQL ini dalam D1 database site masing-masing.
- Table name kekal: entries
- Tarikh dalam WHERE adalah UTC.
- Bacaan:
  DONE | 1       = terbaik, sync berjaya first try
  DONE | 2/3/4   = normal, retry berjaya
  PENDING/FAILED = perlu semak detail error


==================================================
1) SENSORY
SYNC_RETRY_START_AT = 2026-05-25T19:00:00.000Z
==================================================

-- Summary status
SELECT sync_status, sync_attempts, COUNT(*) AS total
FROM entries
WHERE created_at >= '2026-05-25T19:00:00.000Z'
GROUP BY sync_status, sync_attempts
ORDER BY sync_status, sync_attempts;

-- Detail latest records
SELECT id, created_at, sync_status, sync_attempts, sync_error, drive_url
FROM entries
WHERE created_at >= '2026-05-25T19:00:00.000Z'
ORDER BY created_at DESC
LIMIT 20;

-- Problems only
SELECT id, created_at, sync_status, sync_attempts, sync_error
FROM entries
WHERE created_at >= '2026-05-25T19:00:00.000Z'
  AND sync_status IN ('PENDING', 'FAILED')
ORDER BY created_at DESC
LIMIT 50;


